The Huntik team, joined by [[LeBlanche]], used a deck boat to follow the [[Dragon's Breath]] from the coast of [[England]] to [[Avalon]]. When it neared Avalon's shore, it became ensnared in the vines of [[Dark Dryad]], forcing the team to jump from the boat before it hit the rocks and exploded. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

In [[Baja California, Mexico]], the Huntik team later used another deck boat to reach the [[Sea of Cortés]], before they dived down to [[Hernán Cortés' vault]]. {{source|The Power of Umbra}}
